	linkml:definition_uri "https://w3id.org/lmodel/uco/API"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	linkml:description "An API (application programming interface) is a computing interface that defines interactions between multiple software or mixed hardware-software intermediaries. It defines the kinds of calls or requests that can be made, how to make them, the data formats that should be used, the conventions to follow, etc. [based on https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/API]" ;
