<https://w3id.org/lmodel/uco/uco> dcterms:license "Apache-2.0" ;
	dcterms:source "https://github.com/ucoProject/UCO/releases/tag/1.5.0"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	dcterms:title "Unified Cyber Ontology (UCO)" ;
	pav:version "1.5.0" ;
	a linkml:SchemaDefinition ;
	rdfs:seeAlso "https://lmodel.github.io/uco"^^xsd:anyURI , "https://unifiedcyberontology.org/releases/1.5.0/"^^xsd:anyURI ;
	skos:note "Declared in uco_core although their IRIs are in UCO's types namespace, since Event's eventAttribute ranges over them and uco-core imports no other UCO namespace: Dictionary (uco-types:Dictionary), entry (uco-types:entry), DictionaryEntry (uco-types:DictionaryEntry), key (uco-types:key), types_value (uco-types:value)." , "Each module imports the modules its UCO file imports, and this file imports them in that order, so an importer can import one module alone." , "Left out: SHACL advice (severity sh:Info or sh:Warning), SPARQL constraints, sh:not, sh:xone, paths of more than one property, shapes on a property's objects, that hasFacet is inverse functional, and UCO's rule that a UcoThing is never a blank node, which a facet inlined here is when written as RDF." , "The descriptions are UCO's rdfs:comment texts, which the UCO Community publishes under the Apache License 2.0." , "Where UCO defines one local name in more than one namespace, the namespace that comes first in this file's imports keeps it, and each other takes its namespace as a prefix: action_endTime, action_object, action_startTime, action_value, marking_statement, observable_context, observable_cpeid, observable_creator, observable_endTime, observable_eventType, observable_key, observable_location, observable_modifiedTime, observable_participant, observable_references, observable_startTime, observable_swid, observable_value, observable_version, types_value." , "collections/collections.yaml is lmodel/collections' schema at its v0.1.0 release, copied unchanged. It renders the Collections Ontology (CO) 2.0 with CO's names and IRIs, and UCO's threads build on its Bag and CoItem." , "scripts/uco_to_linkml.py writes every YAML file in this folder from UCO's files in upstream/. Change the script or the copy, never the files." ;
	sh:declare _:c14n124 , _:c14n132 , _:c14n149 , _:c14n16 , _:c14n172 , _:c14n175 , _:c14n203 , _:c14n233 , _:c14n246 , _:c14n275 , _:c14n33 , _:c14n344 , _:c14n378 , _:c14n425 , _:c14n492 , _:c14n50 , _:c14n508 , _:c14n53 , _:c14n60 , _:c14n69 ;
